Two pointer apporach

1 st we need to set 'i' as the unique value 
Then we need to compare the i with the next element j ...If both are same we increment j....
If i anf j are not same...They are unique..we need to change the unique value i to the next i++
then the value of j is assigned to i ....then j incremented

